---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const description =
  'What counts as a neolab, how this map encodes valuation, lineage, geography, and research area, and what the data does and does not claim.';
---

<Layout title="Neolabs.fyi | About" description={description} path="/about">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>What's a neolab?</h1>
    <p>
      An AI research, infrastructure, or product lab/company, typically founded by
      researchers/engineers from big labs, professors or post-economic founders.
    </p>
    <p>Some are pre-product/pre-revenue, others are more established.</p>

    <h2>Why are certain labs missing?</h2>
    <p>The neolab definition excludes labs already generating meaningful revenue.</p>
    <details class="about-exclusions">
      <summary>See excluded labs</summary>
      <ul>
        <li>OpenAI</li>
        <li>Anthropic</li>
        <li>DeepMind</li>
        <li>xAI</li>
        <li>Z.ai</li>
        <li>DeepSeek</li>
        <li>Moonshot AI</li>
        <li>MiniMax</li>
        <li>AgiBot</li>
        <li>Prime Intellect</li>
        <li>Mistral</li>
        <li>Cohere</li>
        <li>Runway</li>
        <li>Black Forest Labs</li>
      </ul>
    </details>

    <h2>What am I looking at?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Research area</strong> — neolabs clustered by their primary research focus.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Lineage</strong> — neolabs wired to the organizations their founders came from.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Geography</strong> — where neolabs are primarily headquartered.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Valuation</strong> — a single cluster of all neolabs, with nodes scaled to their
        valuations.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Caveats</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Valuations are messy, and many are likely inaccurate or need better fact-checking.</li>
      <li>
        Headquarters, founder lists, and founder backgrounds may be inaccurate or missing
        information.
      </li>
      <li>
        Many neolabs are actively exploring multiple research areas and don't fit cleanly into a
        single category.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <footer class="colophon">
      <p>
        Made by <a href="https://x.com/polyphilz" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer"
          >@polyphilz</a
        >
      </p>
      <a
        class="colophon-link"
        href="https://github.com/polyphilz/neolabs-fyi"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="Source on GitHub"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
          <path
            fill="currentColor"
            d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82a7.65 7.65 0 0 1 2-.27c.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z"
          />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>
